{"v":4,"catch":"就像你的生命依賴它一樣去奔跑──因為生命確實依賴它。","desc":"在「生存衝刺」中，沒有時間提問。你在黑暗中醒來，森林充滿了生機，他們已經來了。你唯一的選擇？向前走。別停下來。別想了。\n\n躲避、射擊、治療、重複。每一步都是努力的結果，每一公尺都至關重要，而每個陰影都隱藏著比上一個更糟糕的東西。\n\n你不會永遠生存下去──但你或許能存活一段時間。","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2025-05-01","genres":["街機","動作","射擊"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5c287e566078dad74a2963f2c3765d3eb135dcc10b69c1ef2ad3c6a1afa683f8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f6d94f44fbf544c70748e6195df37a63dd001bab41cdfdef550a9ff41142882a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4d165358f64f386ae93f35e9fcd665d831df9d5cb1816f2d00636280b9fedd74.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f3477465d315ecf10171503a67ea02e34a312741cb1dbf912992f0bfbb1dcaa2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2e9eed3b01ae9cc96938b8a9d5f0d2d08be7db90cdc7d4ae3d4459b246ef8242.jpg"],"titleId":"010073e0228bc000","dlc":[]}